WEBVTT

00:28:26.931 --> 00:28:31.914
what each country is bringing
to the development of AI.

00:28:32.272 --> 00:28:35.264
In your book, you talk about
the original, deep science,

00:28:35.288 --> 00:28:39.529
deep computing, innovations,
were developed in the West

00:28:39.553 --> 00:28:44.606
and are currently inside some of the big
US companies, especially Google.

00:28:44.990 --> 00:28:49.188
But that fundamental research in AI

00:28:49.212 --> 00:28:51.895
may not be the key driver
of what happens going forward;

00:28:51.919 --> 00:28:53.276
that there are three other,

00:28:53.300 --> 00:28:56.363
absolutely key determinants
of how this plays out.

00:28:56.387 --> 00:29:00.188
And in each of those other three,
China has a meaningful advantage.